{"sha":"5857e2853c5e81f66c7f0851fff92715668e1876","node_id":"C_kwDOADc1VdoAKDU4NTdlMjg1M2M1ZTgxZjY2YzdmMDg1MWZmZjkyNzE1NjY4ZTE4NzY","commit":{"author":{"name":"Emilio Cobos Álvarez","email":"emilio@crisal.io","date":"2026-06-19T22:31:12Z"},"committer":{"name":"moz-wptsync-bot","email":"wptsync@mozilla.com","date":"2026-07-10T21:23:10Z"},"message":"Fix hash iteration order dependency in attr() cycle detection.\n\nThis fixes attr-cycle failures with my patch for bug 2048926.\n\nThere are two tweaks:\n\n * Change update_attributes_map to not look at type-less attributes\n   eagerly, since they don't introduce extra references.\n\n * Change the cycle code to look at nested attr() references which do\n   get substituted.\n\nAdd a test that fails without this change even without that patch\n(basically the same but with the variables swapped).\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D307865\n\nbugzilla-url: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2049009\ngecko-commit: 9154c145235174b3c0563169a1fb427653e6ca9f\ngecko-commit-git: ad22d6db1a71855af172d0d2b8f00c0ccd8195c0\ngecko-reviewers: dshin, sukil, firefox-style-system-reviewers","tree":{"sha":"f014bb3be6b0352f084d5d3c6236dab6c3414660","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web-platform-tests/wpt/git/trees/f014bb3be6b0352f084d5d3c6236dab6c3414660"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web-platform-tests/wpt/git/commits/5857e2853c5e81f66c7f0851fff92715668e1876","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web-platform-tests/wpt/commits/5857e2853c5e81f66c7f0851fff92715668e1876","html_url":"https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/commit/5857e2853c5e81f66c7f0851fff92715668e1876","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web-platform-tests/wpt/commits/5857e2853c5e81f66c7f0851fff92715668e1876/comments","author":{"login":"emilio","id":1323194,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMjMxOTQ=","avatar_